OL,3,GNEWSAYoung adults with learning
OL,4,Adisabilities make Last Leg TV wrestling
OL,5,Adebut
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of young adults with learning
OL,8,Fdisabilities have described making
OL,9,Ftheir TV wrestling debut on Channel 4
OL,10,Fshow The Last Leg as a "pinch-yourself
OL,11,Fmoment".
OL,13,FThe Tuned In Project offers creative
OL,14,Fand personal development opportunities
OL,15,Ffor people with learning disabilities,
OL,16,Fincluding a wrestling training
OL,17,Fprogramme.
OL,19,FSo when an opportunity came up to
OL,20,Fshowcase their skills on Friday's
OL,21,Fprogramme, the young people jumped at
OL,22,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
