OL,3,GNEWSAYoung adults with learning
OL,4,Adisabilities make Last Leg TV wrestling
OL,5,Adebut
OL,6,
OL,7,FTuned In organiser Sean Curran said
OL,8,Fthey had trained exceptionally hard and
OL,9,Fwere delighted to be able to show off
OL,10,Ftheir skills on Last Leg Mania - a
OL,11,Fsketch which saw the wrestlers come to
OL,12,Fthe aid of host Josh Widdicombe in the
OL,13,Fring.
